 ask the question: <span class=\"italic\">How far is\u2026 ?</span> / <span class=\"italic\">How far is \u2026 from here? </span><br/><br/>You can reply with a specific distance if you know the answer, like <span class=\"italic\">It's 50 yards away</span>.<br/><br/>In the USA, you use the Imperial system, not the metric system. <br/><br/>If a place is nearby, you use yards to say how far it is. <br/><br/>If a place is far, you use miles to say how far it is. "}, {"type": "example", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How far is the end of the wall from here? <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: It's 4,000 miles away."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Imperial System</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Metric System</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 1 mile\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 1.6 kilometers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 1 yard\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 90 centimeters\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1 foot\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 30 centimeters\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 1 inch\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 2.5 centimeters\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the Simple Present tense to say how far a a place is. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Simple Past Tense "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you travel, you ask and report about things you see. You can use the Simple Past tense to report about the things you see. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Who built this?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember, there are regular and irregular verbs. <br/> You use Wh-questions to ask about places you visit. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Why did you decide to visit the Great Wall?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I visited the Great Wall of China."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Many people helped build it."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet. Research the distance between your home city and the places in the table below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Fill out the table."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write sentences about how far each place is."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice asking and saying how far each place is with a partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Place/Attraction \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How far it is from my city? (miles)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Place/Attraction \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How far it is from my city? (miles)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"San Francisco \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Machu Picchu \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Eiffel Tower\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Grand Canyon \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"London Eye\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Great Wall of China\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background i